      "content": "The most effective framing is to expose their \"justice\" as merely a sophisticated form of ideological enforcement. They claim to fight oppression, yet their policies require citizens to submit to a rigid, state-sanctioned moral code, which is the definition of control. Their pursuit of \"equity\" often translates into mandating specific outcomes, effectively punishing those who do not conform to their narrow definition of fairness. Therefore, their justice is not liberation; it is the imposition of a new, politically correct master.",
